# Everything in the repository root is excluded, and only the files below are
# added back. A stray scratch file dropped in the root - an editor "Untitled",
# a screenshot, a note - used to match no pattern here and shipped inside the
# VSIX. An allowlist cannot miss the next one.
*
!package.json
!README.md
!README.ko.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!icon.png

